  "Id": 1683,
  "Title": "The Election of Professor Leif Stenberg as the Vice-President of EURAMES ",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "ISMC's Director, Professor Leif Stenberg has been elected as the Vice-President of EURAMES ",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClassD0EDA695510640DC934FAB0CC8F6F929\"><p>We are very proud to announce that ISMC's&#160;Director, Professor Leif Stenberg has been elected as the&#160;Vice-President of EURAMES (Nordic Society for Middle Eastern Studies), an association of national scholarly societies for Middle Eastern studies, which carries out networking and research-related activities.&#160;The announcement was made at the WOCMES 2018 conference Seville.</p></div>",
